  "title": "Avocado and Bacon Soup",
  "description": "Wonderful way to blend the tastes of avocado and bacon in a warm, hearty soup. Besides the bacon bits, this soup works with a dollop of sour cream and some lime zest. Eat with plenty of crusty bread.",
  "authors": [
